Genomic Investigation Orchestration Workflow
===========================================

              +-----------------------------+
              |   data/dummy_dataset_a.csv  |
              +--------------+--------------+
                             |
                             v
                  +----------------------+
                  | profile_dataset_a    |
                  | (profile_dataset.py) |
                  +----------+-----------+
                             |
                             v
                  +----------------------+
                  | scan_dataset_a       |
                  | (hypothesis_scan.py) |
                  +----------+-----------+
                             |
                             |
                             |            +-----------------------------+
                             |            |   data/dummy_dataset_b.csv  |
                             |            +--------------+--------------+
                             |                           |
                             |                           v
                             |                +----------------------+
                             |                | profile_dataset_b    |
                             |                | (profile_dataset.py) |
                             |                +----------+-----------+
                             |                           |
                             |                           v
                             |                +----------------------+
                             |                | scan_dataset_b       |
                             |                | (hypothesis_scan.py) |
                             |                +----------+-----------+
                             |                           |
                             +-------------+-------------+
                                           |
                                           v
                           +-------------------------------+
                           | validate_joint_findings       |
                           | (validate_findings.py)        |
                           | output/intermediate/*.json    |
                           +---------------+---------------+
                                           |
                                           v
                           +-------------------------------+
                           | publish_team_report           |
                           | (report_team.py)              |
                           | results/*.md + results/*.html |
                           +-------------------------------+

Parallelism:
- profile_dataset_a and profile_dataset_b run in parallel.
- scan_dataset_a and scan_dataset_b run in parallel (after their profiles).
- validation and reporting run sequentially after both scans complete.
